# Results of the expanded-audit repair

Date: 2 October 2026. Authority: the user's request to plan, review and execute
repairs. Baseline: the protected 60-page draft and G1–G18 findings in
`pre-repair-2026-10-02/`. The [plan](../../plans/accounting-gap-repair-2026-10-02.md)
and its [skeptical review](repair-plan-review-2026-10-02.md) preceded execution.

The campaign produced Version 1.1, a substantially more concrete design
candidate. It connects a complete synthetic company to reconstruction,
scenarios, journals and statements; adds a named real disclosure case; supplies
Core 0 contract files and sector examples; and repairs the citation screening.
It does **not** close every wider mission requirement. Partial real-company
semantics, missing primary authority, richer sector methods, implementation and
independent/human acceptance remain explicit below.

